{"id":"n58162-3-8","stage":0,"title":"생각 · 念头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58162-3-8-1","ko":"피자 시켰는데 와서 좀 먹어.","zh":"我点了披萨，过来吃点吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피자","meaning":"比萨","explanation":"피자：比萨。","readings":[{"term":"피자","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26909","senseId":"1","lemma":"피자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피자","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3"}},{"text":"시켰는데","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시켰는데","audio":"/audio/a6ec6918097a5ebcd5be.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어","audio":"/audio/65922367ccfa237c5c51.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"383a267d08e55bc1","term":"피자","zh":"比萨","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3","entryId":"26909","definition":"一种源于意大利的食物，在圆而扁的面饼上面覆盖番茄、肉类、奶酪以及其他配料，并烘烤而成。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0258d8fe6108bb9c","term":"시키다","zh":"点，叫","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3","entryId":"29769","definition":"下单购买食物、酒、饮料等。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b0e267a8005bc689602.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58162-3-8-2","ko":"별로 생각 없어.","zh":"我不太想吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"별로","meaning":"（不）怎么，（不）太","explanation":"별로 在本句与后面的 안、없다、-지 않다 等否定表达合用，合起来表示“不怎么、不太”。否定意义需要和后文一起理解。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"생각","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有（吃东西的意愿）","explanation":"없다：没有（吃东西的意愿）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"（不）怎么，（不）太","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"（不）怎么，（不）太","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":